# Personal Budget & Expense Tracker

## Introduction

This is a Personal Budget and Expense Tracker
developed as part of my Power Learn Project (PLP)
web development training.

The project is designed to help users organize
and monitor their daily expenses.

## Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3

## Project Features

1. Expense entry form.
2. Expense name input.
3. Amount input.
4. Category selection.
5. Expense table.
6. Sample expense records.
7. Collapsible usage instructions.
8. Multimedia content.
9. Responsive styling.

## Project Files

- index.html - Contains the structure of the website.
- style.css - Controls the appearance and layout.
- README.md - Provides information about the project.

## Learning Objectives

Through this project, I practiced:

- HTML table structures.
- HTML forms and input elements.
- Multimedia integration.
- CSS selectors.
- CSS pseudo-classes.
- Browser development tools.

## Author

Developed as part of PLP Web Development Training.